---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import RelatedArticles from '../components/RelatedArticles.astro';
import { forTopics, TOOL_TOPICS } from '../lib/articles.js';
import { hiddenFromSearch } from '../lib/noindex.js';
const path = '/loan/';
---
<Base
  title="Education loan calculator: what borrowing really costs | Universities500"
  description="See the monthly instalment, the interest during study and the total you repay on an education loan, and where Indian applicants can compare lenders."
  path={path}
  noindex={hiddenFromSearch(path)}
  current="loan"
  read={true}
>
  <PageHead slot="head" tone="read" crumbs={[['Education loan guide', '/education-loan-guide/'], ['Loan calculator', null]]} title="Education loan calculator" lede="What borrowing actually costs over the life of the loan, and where to compare lenders." />

  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="h-loan">
    <h2 id="h-loan">If you borrow</h2>
    <p class="sec-lede">An education loan is usually the largest financial commitment a student makes before they have an income. Worth seeing the full cost, not just the monthly figure.</p>
    <div class="calc">
      <div class="tcard">
        <div class="grid2">
          <div class="f"><label for="l-amt">Loan amount</label><input id="l-amt" type="number" value="30000" /></div>
          <div class="f"><label for="l-rate">Interest rate, % a year</label><input id="l-rate" type="number" step="0.1" value="9" /></div>
          <div class="f"><label for="l-course">Course length, years</label><input id="l-course" type="number" step="0.5" value="2" /></div>
          <div class="f"><label for="l-term">Repayment term, years</label><input id="l-term" type="number" step="0.5" value="7" /></div>
        </div>
        <div class="f" style="margin-top:1rem">
          <label for="l-mode">While you are studying</label>
          <select id="l-mode">
            <option value="0">Pay nothing, interest is added to the loan</option>
            <option value="1">Pay the interest as it accrues</option>
          </select>
          <p class="hint">Paying interest during study costs less overall but needs income you may not have.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel" id="l-out" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="src">A simplified model: interest during study is not compounded and repayment is a level monthly instalment on a reducing balance. Real lenders differ on fees, moratorium terms and compounding.</p>

    <h3 class="sec-sub">Where to compare lenders in India</h3>
    <div class="tbl-wrap">
      <table class="tbl">
        <thead><tr><th>Lender</th><th>Type</th><th>Where to look</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Vidya Lakshmi</td><td>Government portal, many banks</td><td>vidyalakshmi.co.in</td></tr>
          <tr><td>State Bank of India</td><td>Public bank</td><td>sbi.co.in</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Bank of Baroda</td><td>Public bank</td><td>bankofbaroda.in</td></tr>
          <tr><td>HDFC Credila</td><td>Non-bank lender</td><td>hdfccredila.com</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Avanse</td><td>Non-bank lender</td><td>avanse.com</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Auxilo</td><td>Non-bank lender</td><td>auxilo.com</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="src">A starting point for an Indian applicant, not a ranking and not complete. Rates, collateral rules and limits change constantly, so check each lender directly.</p>
    <p>For the rules, a longer lender list and a checklist to go through before you sign, read the <a href="/education-loan-guide/">education loan guide</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <p class="note">Every figure here is yours to enter. Nothing is a lending offer. Confirm rates and terms with the lender before acting on any of it.</p>

  <script>import '../scripts/loan.js';</script>
  <RelatedArticles list={forTopics(TOOL_TOPICS['loan'], 3)} heading="Read before you borrow" more={['/articles/', 'All articles']} />
</Base>
